 <h3><u>Quran O Ali Ilm ka Meyaar</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>ya ali ya ali ali ali<br> ya ali ya ali ali ali</p> 
  <p>Allah o Payambar x2<br> kay madadgar hain dono<br> Quran o Ali(A.S) ilm ka mayar hain dono x2</p> 
  <p>ashiq meray mola kay hain dono hain wafadar<br> ik Hazrate Isa hain to ik Messame Tammar<br> haider ki mohabbat main sare dar hain dono</p> 
  <p>kud kehtayhain kuffar ye dawa nahi mera<br> siffin ka lushkur ho ya ho ghat ka pehra<br> ghazi kay liyay rait ki diwar hain dono&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>kaam agaye turbat main meri ulfate Hasnain(A.S)<br> apnay hi aqeeday ke milay muj ko naqeerain<br> meri tarhan Mola kay azadar hain dono</p> 
  <p>Fitrus yehi kehta hua urta hai hawa main<br> Kaabay main dua maang lo ya karbobala main<br> Shabbir(A.S) shenshah kay darbar hain dono&nbsp;</p> 
  <p>maray gaye talwar se jub Marhab O Antar<br> ashab e Payambar se kaha mot nay hans kur<br> do aye thay maidan mai ab char hain dono</p> 
  <p>ik sajda e Mabood se moon mor raha hai<br> ik halqa e matam se hamain tor raha hai<br> tum kuch bhi kaho asl mai ghaddar hain dono</p> 
  <p>ik hai Shab e mairaj Payambar se mukhatib<br> ik hai sare darbar sitam gur se mukhatib<br> lehjay mai magar Haider e karrar(a.s) hai dono</p> 
